        <mxCell id="c72" value="&lt;b&gt;SegmentContext&lt;/b&gt; for a span [s, e]: q = L2( span mean + MLP([span mean, video mean, s/T, e/T]) )&lt;br&gt;q = &lt;b&gt;segment vector&lt;/b&gt;, 512-d (MLP 1026 -&gt; 512 -&gt; 512, last layer zero-init)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
