        <mxCell id="c93" value="&lt;b&gt;pool loss&lt;/b&gt; = cross-entropy of a vector against the whole caption pool (after clip_proj), logit scale learned (init 1/0.07, max 100); soft target 0.5 on the true caption + 0.5 spread over similar captions (softmax of caption-caption cosine / 0.02); rows only see captions of their own dataset" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
